\newlabel{fig:matching_line_matrix}{{7}{12}{Complete matching-line visualizations for five methods and three representative LRO NAC stereo pairs. Rows correspond to SIFT+FLANN, adaptive routing, LoFTR, SuperPoint+LightGlue, and SIFT+LightGlue; columns correspond to sparse-texture, rich-texture, and moderate-texture pairs. Labels in each panel report the number of correspondences retained after the 1~km ground-distance filter and affine-partial RANSAC}{figure.7}{}}
